        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h4 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="任务目标">任务目标：<a class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 任务目标：" title="Direct link to 任务目标：" href="https://pengyuting181.github.io/web.github.io/blog/ORENEXT#%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87">​</a></h4>
<blockquote>
<p>获取清晰的完整矿石mask图像，得到其粒度信息</p>
</blockquote>
<h4 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="矿石粒度信息">矿石粒度信息：<a class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 矿石粒度信息：" title="Direct link to 矿石粒度信息：" href="https://pengyuting181.github.io/web.github.io/blog/ORENEXT#%E7%9F%BF%E7%9F%B3%E7%B2%92%E5%BA%A6%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF">​</a></h4>
<blockquote>
<p>指矿石的粒径、周长、面积等信息。粒度信息是判断破碎机有效性的重要指标，可作为调整各工艺工艺参数的指导作用。</p>
</blockquote>
<h4 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="本文研究重点">本文研究重点：<a class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 本文研究重点：" title="Direct link to 本文研究重点：" href="https://pengyuting181.github.io/web.github.io/blog/ORENEXT#%E6%9C%AC%E6%96%87%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9">​</a></h4>
<blockquote>
<p>针对矿石堆叠问题解决边缘识别精度差的难题</p>
</blockquote>
<h4 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="主要创新点">主要创新点：<a class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 主要创新点：" title="Direct link to 主要创新点：" href="https://pengyuting181.github.io/web.github.io/blog/ORENEXT#%E4%B8%BB%E8%A6%81%E5%88%9B%E6%96%B0%E7%82%B9">​</a></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>边缘引导的loss:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>本模型的损失函数包含回归定位的检测框损失函数和边缘点引导匹配的掩码损失函数<!-- -->
<ul>
<li>
<p>检测框损失函数：采用点到点距离预测的方法，将预测点和真实边框输入，将预测点坐标按照x或y方向排序（将pts坐标拆分成x坐标和y坐标），得到新的坐标。</p>
<hr>
<p>然后计算每个点到四个边框之间的距离，得到每个边框点的图像边界损失，最后通过加权求和得到该图像的平均边界点回归损失。</p>
<div class="language-python codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-python codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">pts_y </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> pts_reshape</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">0</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">if</span><span class="token plain"> y_first </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">else</span><span class="token plain"> pts_reshape</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">pts_x </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> pts_reshape</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">if</span><span class="token plain"> y_first </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:#00009f">else</span><span class="token plain"> pts_reshape</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">0</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">loss_left </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token plain">gt_bboxes</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">0</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">unsqueeze</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">-</span><span class="token plain"> pts_x</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">clamp_</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token builtin">min</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">0</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">unsqueeze</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">loss_right </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token plain">pts_x </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">-</span><span class="token plain"> gt_bboxes</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">2</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">unsqueeze</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">clamp_</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token builtin">min</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">0</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">unsqueeze</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">loss_up </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token plain">gt_bboxes</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">unsqueeze</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">-</span><span class="token plain"> pts_y</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">clamp_</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token builtin">min</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">0</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">unsqueeze</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">loss_bottom </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token plain">pts_y </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">-</span><span class="token plain"> gt_bboxes</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">:</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">3</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">unsqueeze</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">clamp_</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token builtin">min</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">0</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">unsqueeze</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">loss </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> torch</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">cat</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">[</span><span class="token plain">loss_left</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> loss_right</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> loss_up</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> loss_bottom</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> dim</span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token number" style="color:#36acaa">1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
</li>
<li>
<p>掩码损失函数：首先计算预测点和真实边界点的最小L2距离（欧式距离），来匹配预测点与目标点。</p>
<div class="language-python codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_biex"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-python codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">pred_item1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> target_item1 </span><span class="token operator" style="color:#393A34">=</span><span class="token plain"> self</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">.</span><span class="token plain">get_pred_targets_item1</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">(</span><span class="token plain">cls_score</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> cls_score</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">,</span><span class="token plain"> label</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:#393A34">)</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__atx"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_eSgA" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_y97N"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_LjdS"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<hr>
<p>然后，使用损失函数<code>smoothL1</code>对预测点和目标点进行动态匹配。</p>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="loss" src="https://pengyuting181.github.io/web.github.io/assets/images/EGL-ea74d080b02e44ee22b8c9b7a49c4fbe.png" width="1697" height="562" class="img_ev3q"></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>局部信息和全局信息的平衡</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Backbone使用类Transformer的MLP架构，并引入了位移操作捕获局部依赖关系，更细致的得到低层次的特征，即轮廓、颜色、形状等特征，从而产生更全面的边缘信息。</li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="BACKBONE" src="https://pengyuting181.github.io/web.github.io/assets/images/vertical%20shift-3fa25712ec484a65d4980d6983c37f69.png" width="1312" height="214" class="img_ev3q"></p>
<ul>
<li>Neck部分叠加了两个SparseMLP模块，使用较低的计算复杂度得到与CNN相似的感受野，提取全局信息，使其尽量不遗漏小目标。</li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="neck" src="https://pengyuting181.github.io/web.github.io/assets/images/FPN-d16bc9681873b9b33417b839141301e2.png" width="971" height="381" class="img_ev3q"></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>轻量化</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>现有研究提出，transformer架构的优秀性能来源于其结构的优雅，与attention机制无关。采用MLP架构，继承了transformer结构的优越性，是网络结构更简洁高效。</li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="backbone" src="https://pengyuting181.github.io/web.github.io/assets/images/stonemlp++-232e0843636b83970098cbace0c5d288.png" width="1084" height="708" class="img_ev3q"></p>
</li>
</ul>]]></content>
